"sub": "Your caf\u00e9 is on fire."
},
{
"id": "f11",
"f": 44.356,
"dur": 3.358,
"who": "fine",
"sub": "It's been on fire since 2021. You get used to it."
},
{
"id": "f12",
"f": 48.064,
"dur": 4.873,
"who": "fine",
"sub": "You want the Keyholder. Everyone wants the Keyholder. She opens any door in the Memetrix."
},
{
"id": "t10",
"f": 53.287,
"dur": 2.153,
"who": "toshi",
"sub": "Twelve words. I never say them out loud."
},
{
"id": "f13",
"f": 55.79,
